  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nCompletes the transfer-coupled census across every unordered shape `(p,a,b)` with `p+a+b=7`, answering open question 1 of [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) and the remaining-shapes follow-up left by [#2817](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2817) (`(5,1,1)`-only) in the five-source common-B mutable-source alphabet of [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898).\n\n| Shape `(p,a,b)` | Covering pairs | Exact min R | Tariff floor (C=1) | Undercuts 436? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Same-walk even-subset (#2686) | \u2014 | \u226582 | \u2265442 at X=6 | no |\n| Partitioned dual (#2779) | \u2014 | \u2265112 | \u2265490 at X=0 | no |\n| `(5,1,1)` transfer-coupled | **8749440** | **84** | **\u2265439** (X\u22652) | **no** |\n| `(4,1,2)` | **34997760** | **86** | **\u2265439** at X=0 | **no** |\n| All other unordered shapes | \u2014 | **\u226588** | **\u2265443** at X=0 | **no** |\n\nGlobal covering minimum is `R=84` at `(5,1,1)` only. Gray `X=0` covering on that shape is empty, and fair path `X` is always even, so covering forces `X\u22652` and tariff `\u2265439>436`. Every other unordered shape already has `R\u226586`.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2817](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2817) was not reopened (freestanding package path).\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q/`.\nTip: `b4e312f952aea55a0b9f013a1d152423f6cf0f56`.\n\nExact: global min R **84** (only at `(5,1,1)` with X\u22652); companions R\u226586; tariff floor **439**; no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q_OBSTRUCTION global_min_R=84 ... tariff_floor=439 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q companions=7 ... tariff_floor=439 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_TRANSFER_COUPLED_7Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/transfer-coupled-all-shapes-7q outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes. Requires `gcc` for local `dual.c` (Python fallback available).\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2817](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2817) (`(5,1,1)`-only fair-X floor 452), [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779). Freestanding full-shape census; no competing open PR on this package path at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2817 / #2779 / #2761 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
